)、毛先少し水色\n目：タレ目気味(藍色、くすんだ青)\n服：オーバーサイズなパーカー 制服\nその他：魚のヘアピン\n\n ﹍ ﹍ ﹍ ﹍ ﹍ ﹍ ﹍\n\n▼モチーフにして頂きたい動物\n猫 (ラグドールのような長毛種)\n\n瞳や毛色は詳細から引っ張って頂いても、雰囲気で変更しても大丈夫です。\n\n\n\n難しければキャンセルしていただいて構いません。\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TcjcxxWirGwbSuH8hS9zMHQE6_m09FYR", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 55691, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ひるなか", "screen_name": "hirunaka_ymtk", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1592754984214757377/uZ20ThO6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1128205804857729024/1714868819/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 107555, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "𓅿ﾓﾛﾂﾖｼ👿✊依頼はskebのみ", "screen_name": "moro_244", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976122226131992578/lghbD1ds.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2715918024/1636784936/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 1139872, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "地下鉄", "screen_name": "jf5437", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1511660512362131457/ILzmJ5vo.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1161662746204573696/1609517848/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "del